Firmware for 'make check-temp' and 'make check-new-temp': temperature sensing on D3, the bus pin
of the new board (and a free pin on the old one; below 14, as the firmware requires, and not
D2/D10-D13, which RF builds use). The two sensors of config.h sit on the bus (configs/ds18b20.scn,
in the board files of these targets): each reset and each 0 written keeps interrupts off for its
1-Wire time slot (70 and 65 us), which these builds measure against the ADC interrupt's deadline,
and the datalog must report both temperatures.

  PVR_SIM_BUILD=1 sh sim/configs/sim_config.sh NEW          # or without NEW, for check-temp
  git apply --unidiff-zero sim/configs/temperature.patch
  PLATFORMIO_BUILD_DIR=.pio/build-new-temp pio run --project-dir Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp -e basic    # build-temp for the old board
  git checkout Mk2_3phase_RFdatalog_temp/config.h
  make -C sim check-new-temp

